## 🏗️ struct — 创建自己的类型

---

### 定义与使用

```c
struct Student {
    char name[50];
    int age;
    float score;
};

int main() {
    struct Student s1 = {"Alice", 20, 92.5};

    // 访问成员
    printf("Name: %s\n", s1.name);
    printf("Age: %d\n", s1.age);
    printf("Score: %.1f\n", s1.score);
    return 0;
}

```

---

### 结构体数组

```c
struct Student class[3] = {
    {"Alice", 20, 92.5},
    {"Bob", 21, 85.0},
    {"Charlie", 19, 78.5}
};

for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    printf("%s: %.1f\n", class[i].name, class[i].score);
}

```

---

### typedef 简化

```c
typedef struct {
    char name[50];
    int age;
} Person;

Person p1 = {"Alice", 20};  // 不需要 struct 关键字

```

---

### 访问运算符

| 符号 | 用法 |
|------|------|
| `.` | 直接访问: `s.name` |
| `->` | 指针访问: `ps->name` |

